with same set\". Actually the meaning is essentially the same — the group shares the talent set. I won't flag. Empty.\n\nQ009: empty. Q012 FINDING as discussed. Actually re-examine Q012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\". Two issues: \"我的\" addition and \"profile\"→\"用户信息\" conflating with \"Show infos\" (显示信息). Given the menu has \"Show infos\" (ui=\"show\", shows UserInfo dialog) and \"Open profile\" (opens web URL data.profile), translating profile as 用户信息 conflicts. I'll report FINDING: target span \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\", claim ADDITION, correction \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\", evidence \"util.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\" — verbatim from context. Yes that's verbatim.\n\nAlso, \"Show infos\" appears in context, supporting the distinction. One candidate enough.\n\nQ016: also \"DEBUG\" → \"调试模式\" fine.\n\nNow double-check Q011 correction: \"这就是维网。\" Hmm, \"the Way\" elsewhere translated as 维网? In target \"这不是维网\" suggests established term \"维网\" for the Way. Correction: \"这就是维网。\"\n\nQ001: check \"after letting her grow as powerful as possible\" → \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她\" — \"letting her grow\" implies allowing her to grow (you let her grow). 成长到尽可能强大之后 captures. Fine.\n\nQ015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer\" — 获得称号 fine.\n\nQ007: fine.\n\nQ003: fine.\n\nQ018: fine.\n\nNow candidates per item:\n\nQ004: 1 finding.\nQ006: 1 finding.\nQ010: 1 finding.\nQ011: 1 finding.\nQ012: 1 finding.\nQ013: 1 finding.\nQ014: 1 finding.\nQ016: 1 finding.\nQ017: 1 finding.\nQ019: 1 finding.\nQ020: 1 finding.\n\nOthers empty.\n\nObservation strings: brief neutral description.\n\nQ017 verdict: FINDING or UNCERTAIN? \"你永远无法理解的文字\" — addition of \"永远\". Compare Q013 where addition clearly wrong. For Q017, the \"永远\" is an unjustified intensifier changing \"do not understand\" to \"can never understand\". I'll mark FINDING (ADDITION). Hmm — but one might argue \"which you do not understand\" describing mysterious runes could be rendered \"你无法理解的文字\", and \"永