nd _t[[which you do not understand:\".\n\nHmm, is \"even if you knew Shertul\" truly a defect? It says the text is incomprehensible regardless. In-game, if you speak shertul you get translation. So the claim is false in-game, and unsupported. I'll report FINDING CONDITION.\n\nQ014: \"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\" → \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\" Context: the SOURCE_MATCH is in GOLD_DONATOR achievement; Silver Donator is \"at least 6 euros\". Target says \"达到白银捐赠等级\" (reaching Silver donator level) — the achievement is \"Gold Donator\". Adding \"达到白银捐赠等级\" contradicts context (GOLD_DONATOR). FINDING, ADDITION/VALUE. Target span \"达到白银捐赠等级\". Correction: remove, e.g. \"为《马基·埃亚尔的传说》捐赠至少 16 欧元。\" Evidence: \"name = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\"\" verbatim.\n\nAlso game title \"Tales of Maj'Eyal\" → \"马基·埃亚尔的传说\" fine.\n\nQ015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\" → \"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\" fine. Achievement name \"XXX the Destroyer\". OK.\n\nQ016: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" → \"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\". \"Alter\" → \"锁定\" (lock) — DIRECTION/VALUE error. \"Alter Faction\" means change faction; \"锁定阵营\" means lock faction. FINDING. Target span \"锁定阵营\". Correction: \"更改阵营\" or \"改变阵营\". Evidence: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" — wait, evidence must be verbatim in source: source is \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\". Yes.\n\nQ017: \"which you do not understand:\" → \"你永远无法理解的文字：\" — \"永远\" (never/forever) added. Source: \"which you do not understand\" (current state). \"你永远无法理解\" = \"which you can never understand\". Addition of permanence. Is it substantive? It changes STATE to permanent. Similar to Q013 but weaker. Hmm. The context: this is the branch when player does not speak shertul; if they later speak shertul, they'd get the translation (actually lore is read once?). The addition \"永远\" is an intensifier not in source. Is it objectively wrong? It asserts inability forever, whereas source asserts current non-understanding. I'd say FINDING VALUE/STATE... or UNCERTAIN. \"which you do not understand\" — describing the text as incomprehensible to you; \"永远无法理解\" adds \"never\". It's a real semantic addition. I'll report FINDING with claim_type STATE, correction \"你无法理解的文字\". Hmm, could argue it's stylistic intensification. But \"never\" vs \"do not\" is a temporal/scope change. I'll go FINDING... Actually, being cautious: many translation reviews would flag 永远 as addition. Rule 3: added info compatible with visible evidence and cannot be judged wrong by evidence — can it be judged wrong? The evidence shows a translated version exists for shertul speakers, so \"永远无法理解\" is falsifiable within game logic? If a player learns shertul later... lore already read. Eh. I'll mark UNCERTAIN. Hmm, decide: FINDING for Q013 (condition contradiction) and UNCERTAIN for Q017 (adds 永远). Actually Q017's addition similar to Q013 but without the \"即使你懂\" clause. \"你永远无法理解的文字\" vs \"which you do not understand\". The \"永远\" adds permanence. I'll report as FINDING with STATE? Let me think about severity: \"do not understand\" → \"永远无法理解\" is a clear addition of \"永远\" with no source basis. That's an objective ADDITION. But is it substantive? It changes the meaning. I'll report FINDING, ADDITION, correction \"你无法理解的文字\", evidence \"which you do not understand:\". Evidence verbatim: \"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth...\" — the source is exactly that. Use \"which you do not understand:\".\n\nHmm, but rule 3 could make 永远 permissible embellishment? It's not \"specific information\" like a number or name; it's a modal/temporal change. I'll keep FINDING but maybe UNCERTAIN is safer. I'll go FINDING — actually let me reconsider: reviewers flag \"永远\" as over-translation, changing meaning. Yes, FINDING.\n\nWait, Q013 vs Q017: Q013's addition \"即使你懂夏·图尔语\" is stronger and directly contradicted. Q013 FINDING. Q017 FINDING (ADDITION). Fine.\n\nQ018: \"Got a character to level 50.\" → \"角色达到50级。\" fine.\n\nQ019: \"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\" → \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\" Source asks about the chest auto-extracting gems. Target adds \"即使我不会提取宝石\" (even if I don't know the extract gems talent). Context: the option's cond requires \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\" — the option only appears when the player DOES know Extract Gems talent. So the addition \"即使我不会提取宝石\" contradicts the visible condition. FINDING, ADDITION/CONDITION. Target span \"即使我不会提取宝石\". Correction: \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\". Evidence: \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end}\" verbatim: \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\". Let me get exact substring: `cond=function(npc, player) return not q:isCompleted(\"transmo-chest-extract-gems\") and q:isCompleted(\"transmo-chest\") and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end},` — I'll use \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end\".\n\nQ020: \"The Legend of Garkul\" → \"加库尔的八章传说\". Context desc: \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\" and five garkul-history lore checks. \"八章\" (eight) contradicts \"five chapters\". FINDING, VALUE. Target span \"八章\". Correction: \"加库尔的传说\" (or 五章). Evidence: \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\".\n\nNow Q004 similar: FINDING with evidence \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" Target \"七章\" correction \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" or \"魔法大爆炸的八章故事\"? The name \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" doesn't specify chapters; safest correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" (remove 七章). Claim VALUE.\n\nQ005: reconsider. \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" → \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" Issues: \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" (read) — semantics: learned vs read; minor. \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a proper title \"魔法大爆炸编年史\" — target says \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" — loses the title. Is that a substantive defect? The source is an achievement description; \"the Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a specific work. Translating as generic \"有关魔法大爆炸的文献\" loses REFERENT specificity. Also \"八\" vs \"8\" trivial. Hmm, \"Learned the eight chapters of X\" → \"阅读了有关X的8章文献\" — \"the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles\" = the 8 chapters that constitute the Chronicles; \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" = 8 chapters of documents about the Spellblaze. Roughly equivalent meaning. \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\": learned implies acquiring knowledge, reading implies the act. In achievement context, \"Learned\" means you've read/collected all. This is borderline style. I'll report no candidates for Q005, or UNCERTAIN for \"阅读了\" vs \"习得\". I'll leave empty.\n\nQ006: also check \"Failed!\" → \"失败了！\" fine. One candidate.\n\nQ002: reconsider names: \"Gorran\" → \"高岚\" is a creative transliteration; not judgeable as error without external knowledge? Well, transliteration difference isn't objective defect per se. \"Iron Throne\" → \"钢铁王座\" fine. \"read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" — the hyperbole: eyes so fine he can read Last Hope's tavern sign while sitting in Derth's tavern. Target: \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — matches. \"beardling\" → \"毛脸小子\": beardling is a dwarf term for immature dwarf (ironic since target is dwarf). \"毛脸小子\" loses the beard reference but... minor. \"I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again\" → \"我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了\" fine. \"dead wood\" → 废物 fine. \"I wouldn't put it past a dwarf to...\" → \"矮人……也不是做不出来\" fine. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets\" — \"为了翻我们的口袋，故意把我们领上这座鬼山送死\" — fine. OK, empty.\n\nQ008: reconsider subject: \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\" → \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\" — \"they\" (friends) → \"你们\" (you pl). Semantic shift: source says friends can play with same talents (as the player); target says \"you (player+friends) can play with same set\". Actually the meaning is essentially the same — the group shares the talent set. I won't flag. Empty.\n\nQ009: empty. Q012 FINDING as discussed. Actually re-examine Q012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\". Two issues: \"我的\" addition and \"profile\"→\"用户信息\" conflating with \"Show infos\" (显示信息). Given the menu has \"Show infos\" (ui=\"show\", shows UserInfo dialog) and \"Open profile\" (opens web URL data.profile), translating profile as 用户信息 conflicts. I'll report FINDING: target span \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\", claim ADDITION, correction \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\", evidence \"util.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\" — verbatim from context. Yes that's verbatim.\n\nAlso, \"Show infos\" appears in context, supporting the distinction. One candidate enough.\n\nQ016: also \"DEBUG\" → \"调试模式\" fine.\n\nNow double-check Q011 correction: \"这就是维网。\" Hmm, \"the Way\" elsewhere translated as 维网? In target \"这不是维网\" suggests established term \"维网\" for the Way. Correction: \"这就是维网。\"\n\nQ001: check \"after letting her grow as powerful as possible\" → \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她\" — \"letting her grow\" implies allowing her to grow (you let her grow). 成长到尽可能强大之后 captures. Fine.\n\nQ015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer\" — 获得称号 fine.\n\nQ007: fine.\n\nQ003: fine.\n\nQ018: fine.\n\nNow candidates per item:\n\nQ004: 1 finding.\nQ006: 1 finding.\nQ010: 1 finding.\nQ011: 1 finding.\nQ012: 1 finding.\nQ013: 1 finding.\nQ014: 1 finding.\nQ016: 1 finding.\nQ017: 1 finding.\nQ019: 1 finding.\nQ020: 1 finding.\n\nOthers empty.\n\nObservation strings: brief neutral description.\n\nQ017 verdict: FINDING or UNCERTAIN? \"你永远无法理解的文字\" — addition of \"永远\". Compare Q013 where addition clearly wrong. For Q017, the \"永远\" is an unjustified intensifier changing \"do not understand\" to \"can never understand\". I'll mark FINDING (ADDITION). Hmm — but one might argue \"which you do not understand\" describing mysterious runes could be rendered \"你无法理解的文字\", and \"永远\" is emphatic over-translation. It's a real semantic addition. FINDING.\n\nOutput JSON.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q001\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文准确传达了'让她成长到尽可能强大之后将其杀死'的含义，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q002\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"人物身份、夸张修辞（在德斯镇酒馆读到最后希望城的招牌）、方向与语气均与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q003\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"斗篷隐藏真实本质、他人只会看到普通人类等要点均完整对应，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q004\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"七章\",\n          \"correction\": \"魔法大爆炸的故事（不应出现'七章'这一具体章数）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"同一条目上下文明确该成就需要收集八章文献，译文'七章'与可见证据中的'eight chapters'矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q005\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'Learned the eight chapters'译为'阅读了……8章文献'，章数与含义基本对应，无可由可见证据判定的实质缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q006\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"SCOPE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"主线任务\",\n          \"correction\": \"任务\",\n          \"evidence\": \"[-1] = _t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#New#LAST# Quest!\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该文件是通用任务状态提示（New/Updated/Completed/Failed），适用于所有任务；译文限定为'主线任务'，扩大了原文'Quest'的范围。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q007\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'必须装备（wear）该物品才能使用'与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q008\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'点击复制''分享种子使朋友可用同一套技能游玩'与原文含义相容；'随机'为与上下文相容的补充，不构成缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q009\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'不是来聊天，是来阻止你们'忠实再现'Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!'，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q010\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"correction\": \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Display mouse gesture trails\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文设置项为'Display'（显示），上下文状态函数也按 hide_gestures 取反显示 enabled/disabled，译文'隐藏'方向相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q011\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"这不是维网。\",\n          \"correction\": \"这就是维网。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"This is the Way.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文为肯定句'This is the Way.'，译文加入否定词'不'，语义完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q012\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\",\n          \"correction\": \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"util.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该项是对聊天列表中所选用户的操作（打开其网页 profile），并非'我的'用户信息；且与菜单中'Show infos'（显示信息）项相区分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q013\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解的文字\",\n          \"evidence\": \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"此文本仅在玩家不懂夏·图尔语时显示，懂夏·图尔语时显示的是译文分支；'即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解'与可见的条件分支相矛盾，且为原文所无。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q014\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"达到白银捐赠等级\",\n          \"correction\": \"删除该补充：为《马基·埃亚尔的传说》捐赠至少 16 欧元。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"name = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该描述属于'Gold Donator'（黄金捐赠者）成就，译文补充'达到白银捐赠等级'与可见证据直接矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q015\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'在竞技场中获得毁灭者称号'与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q016\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ACTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"锁定阵营\",\n          \"correction\": \"更改阵营\",\n          \"evidence\": \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"'Alter'意为更改/改变，译文'锁定'含义完全不同。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q017\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"你永远无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解的文字\",\n          \"evidence\": \"which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文仅陈述'你看不懂'的当前状态，译文加入'永远'将状态改为永久性，属无依据的添加。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q018\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'角色达到50级'与'Got a character to level 50.'一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q019\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使我不会提取宝石\",\n          \"correction\": \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"上下文显示该选项仅在玩家已掌握'提取宝石'天赋时出现，译文'即使我不会提取宝石'与可见条件相矛盾，且为原文所无。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q020\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"八章\",\n          \"correction\": \"加库尔的传说（或'五章'）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"同一成就的描述明确为五章（garkul-history-1 至 5），译文'八章'与可见证据矛盾。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10688,"output":6769,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4935,"totalTokens":17457,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984354347,"responseId":"2026082914191514ed7af2a1894023","rawStopReason":"stop"}}
{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me review each item.\n\nQ001: source \"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\" target \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\" — accurate. \"after letting her grow\" — 成长到尽可能强大之后, fine. No issue.\n\nQ002: source is Gorran, Cornac Archer. Target: \"科纳克人弓箭手，高岚\". \"addlepated beardling\" → \"没脑子的毛脸小子\" — beardling refers to a young/immature dwarf; Gorran calls Sodelost beardling. \"毛脸小子\" is plausible. \"The finest eyes of the Iron Throne, able to read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth!\" Target: \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — from the tavern in Derth reading the sign in Last Hope. Direction: he's in Derth reading Last Hope's sign. Translation says \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — sitting in Derth's tavern can see Last Hope's tavern sign. That matches. Names: Gorran → 高岚 (odd transliteration but allowed?). Last Hope → 最后的希望城, Derth → 德斯镇, Sodelost → 苏达罗斯特, Relle → 瑞丽. \"I'm effectively dead wood to the team\" → \"对队伍而言简直成了废物\" ok. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die\" — ok. Seems fine. Maybe \"还自称斥候！还说自己是钢铁王座眼力最好的家伙\" — \"A scout he calls himself!\" fine. No finding.\n\nActually check \"coin-hounding\" → 追着钱跑, fine. \"stump-kneed\" → 短腿跛脚, ok.\n\nQ003: \"I can give you a cloak that will conceal your true nature! With it all people will see when they look at you is a normal average Human. You can go about your business. Please!\" Target matches. \"Please!\" → \"求求你！\" fine. No issue.\n\nQ004: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" → \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\". Context: achievement desc \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" — the game has eight chapters, so \"七章\" (seven chapters) contradicts \"eight chapters\" in visible context. FINDING, VALUE/ADDITION. Target span \"七章\". Correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" or 八章. Evidence: \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" Note \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" is also the game title; but the numeric error is objective.\n\nQ005: \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" → \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" Hmm — \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a specific title (编年史). \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" loses title specificity but that's minor. \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" (read) vs learned; acceptable? Learned vs read — slight change but plausibly fine. Also the original is a title \"Spellblaze Chronicles\". I'd say no strong objective defect. Could flag \"阅读了\" vs \"习得/学会了\"? That's style. Skip.\n\nQ006: \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\" → \"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\". \"Quest\" → \"主线任务\" — quest isn't necessarily main quest; visible context shows generic quests (New Quest!, Quest Updated!, etc.). Claiming \"main quest\" is an addition/scope error. FINDING, SCOPE/VALUE. Target span \"主线任务\". Correction: \"任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\". Evidence: \"[-1] = _t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#New#LAST# Quest!\\\",\" showing generic quests.\n\nQ007: \"You must wear this object to use it!\" → \"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\" fine. wear → 装备, ok.\n\nQ008: \"Click to copy to clipboard. You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\" Target: \"点击复制。你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\" \"they can play\" → \"你们可以\" (you all can) — direction/subject change? \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\" — friends can play. Target \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合\" — \"你们\" plural includes the player. Hmm, is that a defect? It changes \"they\" (friends) to \"you (plural)\". Slight subject change but meaning roughly compatible... Actually \"they can play with the same set of talents\" means friends play with same talents as the player. \"你们可以用同一套技能组合\" implies both share. This is arguably fine semantically. Also \"wanderer seed\" → \"流浪者随机种子\" — added 随机 (random), addition but compatible per rule 3. \"Click to copy to clipboard\" → \"点击复制\" — omits clipboard, minor omission; context shows \"Copied to clipboard!\" popup. Is omitting \"to clipboard\" a substantive omission? Minor. I could report as UNCERTAIN or skip. I'll skip; meaning retained adequately? The instruction says report objective substantive defects. Omission of \"到剪贴板\" is minor, not substantive. Skip.\n\nQ009: \"Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!\" → \"我不是来和你们聊天的，我是来阻止你们的！\" Meaning preserved. Fine.\n\nQ010: \"Display mouse gesture trails\" → \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\" — Display → 隐藏 (hide). Direct VALUE/DIRECTION error. FINDING. Target span \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\". Correction: \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\". Evidence: \"Display mouse gesture trails\" and status function \"config.settings.hide_gestures and _t\\\"disabled\\\" or _t\\\"enabled\\\"\" confirming the setting is display. FINDING.\n\nQ011: \"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse. ... This is the Way.\" → target last line \"这不是维网。\" — \"This is the Way\" → \"这不是维网\" adds negation \"不\" and \"维网\" weird. Source: \"This is the Way.\" Target \"这不是维网。\" — clear VALUE error (added negation). FINDING. Correction: \"这就是维网。\" or \"这就是'道'。\" Target span \"这不是维网。\". Evidence: \"This is the Way.\".\n\nAlso first line \"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\" → \"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\" fine.\n\nQ012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\". \"profile\" → \"我的用户信息\" — profile vs user info; context has separate \"Show infos\" item. \"Open profile\" opens the web profile (data.profile URL). Translating as \"用户信息\" conflicts with \"Show infos\"? Hmm. \"profile\" → \"用户资料\" would be better. Is \"打开我的用户信息\" a defect? It's a chat user's profile, not \"my\". \"我的\" (my) — the profile belongs to the clicked user, not \"me\". That's a REFERENT/SUBJECT error. Also context: listPopup(\"User: %s\") — the menu is for a user. \"我的用户信息\" — added \"my\". Hmm, could be interpretation as \"打开(该)用户资料\". The \"我的\" is questionable but maybe it's a common phrasing? Objective: source \"Open profile\" opens the profile of the selected user (citem.login). Adding \"我的\" changes referent. I'd report UNCERTAIN or FINDING. I think FINDING: REFERENT, span \"我的用户信息\", correction \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\", evidence \"local data = profile.chat:getUserInfo(citem.login)\" plus \"{name=_t\\\"Show infos\\\"...\" showing it's another user's profile. Evidence must be verbatim from source_context: \"if citem and citem.login then\" — I'll use \"local data = profile.chat:getUserInfo(citem.login)\". That's verbatim.\n\nQ013: \"which you do not understand:\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：\" — \"which you do not understand\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解\" (even if you know Sher'Tul you cannot understand). This changes condition — the source is plain \"you do not understand\". The addition \"即使你懂夏·图尔语\" is contradictory with the context: this text is shown when player does NOT speak shertul (not game.player:attr(\"speaks_shertul\")). So saying \"even if you knew Sher'Tul\" is an addition not supported; actually contradicts? The branch is when player doesn't speak Shertul. Claim \"even if you knew Shertul language, you can't understand\" is added info. Is it compatible? Hmm, per rule 3, new info compatible with evidence and can't be judged wrong by evidence... The context shows this string appears when the player does not speak shertul. The claim \"even if you understand Sher'Tul you cannot understand this text\" — is it contradicted? The parallel string for speakers shows translated text, meaning if you speak shertul you CAN understand. So the addition is arguably contradicted by the visible alternative branch which shows the translated text when speaks_shertul is true. So it's a CONDITION error — adding \"即使你懂夏·图尔语\" (even if you know Sher'Tul). I'd report FINDING: ADDITION/CONDITION. Target span \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\". Correction: \"你无法理解的文字\". Evidence: \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\" and the or-branch showing translated text. Evidence string must be verbatim: \"(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\" — verbatim from context. Use \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\".\n\nHmm, is \"even if you knew Shertul\" truly a defect? It says the text is incomprehensible regardless. In-game, if you speak shertul you get translation. So the claim is false in-game, and unsupported. I'll report FINDING CONDITION.\n\nQ014: \"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\" → \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\" Context: the SOURCE_MATCH is in GOLD_DONATOR achievement; Silver Donator is \"at least 6 euros\". Target says \"达到白银捐赠等级\" (reaching Silver donator level) — the achievement is \"Gold Donator\". Adding \"达到白银捐赠等级\" contradicts context (GOLD_DONATOR). FINDING, ADDITION/VALUE. Target span \"达到白银捐赠等级\". Correction: remove, e.g. \"为《马基·埃亚尔的传说》捐赠至少 16 欧元。\" Evidence: \"name = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\"\" verbatim.\n\nAlso game title \"Tales of Maj'Eyal\" → \"马基·埃亚尔的传说\" fine.\n\nQ015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\" → \"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\" fine. Achievement name \"XXX the Destroyer\". OK.\n\nQ016: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" → \"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\". \"Alter\" → \"锁定\" (lock) — DIRECTION/VALUE error. \"Alter Faction\" means change faction; \"锁定阵营\" means lock faction. FINDING. Target span \"锁定阵营\". Correction: \"更改阵营\" or \"改变阵营\". Evidence: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" — wait, evidence must be verbatim in source: source is \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\". Yes.\n\nQ017: \"which you do not understand:\" → \"你永远无法理解的文字：\" — \"永远\" (never/forever) added. Source: \"which you do not understand\" (current state). \"你永远无法理解\" = \"which you can never understand\". Addition of permanence. Is it substantive? It changes STATE to permanent. Similar to Q013 but weaker. Hmm. The context: this is the branch when player does not speak shertul; if they later speak shertul, they'd get the translation (actually lore is read once?). The addition \"永远\" is an intensifier not in source. Is it objectively wrong? It asserts inability forever, whereas source asserts current non-understanding. I'd say FINDING VALUE/STATE... or UNCERTAIN. \"which you do not understand\" — describing the text as incomprehensible to you; \"永远无法理解\" adds \"never\". It's a real semantic addition. I'll report FINDING with claim_type STATE, correction \"你无法理解的文字\". Hmm, could argue it's stylistic intensification. But \"never\" vs \"do not\" is a temporal/scope change. I'll go FINDING... Actually, being cautious: many translation reviews would flag 永远 as addition. Rule 3: added info compatible with visible evidence and cannot be judged wrong by evidence — can it be judged wrong? The evidence shows a translated version exists for shertul speakers, so \"永远无法理解\" is falsifiable within game logic? If a player learns shertul later... lore already read. Eh. I'll mark UNCERTAIN. Hmm, decide: FINDING for Q013 (condition contradiction) and UNCERTAIN for Q017 (adds 永远). Actually Q017's addition similar to Q013 but without the \"即使你懂\" clause. \"你永远无法理解的文字\" vs \"which you do not understand\". The \"永远\" adds permanence. I'll report as FINDING with STATE? Let me think about severity: \"do not understand\" → \"永远无法理解\" is a clear addition of \"永远\" with no source basis. That's an objective ADDITION. But is it substantive? It changes the meaning. I'll report FINDING, ADDITION, correction \"你无法理解的文字\", evidence \"which you do not understand:\". Evidence verbatim: \"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth...\" — the source is exactly that. Use \"which you do not understand:\".\n\nHmm, but rule 3 could make 永远 permissible embellishment? It's not \"specific information\" like a number or name; it's a modal/temporal change. I'll keep FINDING but maybe UNCERTAIN is safer. I'll go FINDING — actually let me reconsider: reviewers flag \"永远\" as over-translation, changing meaning. Yes, FINDING.\n\nWait, Q013 vs Q017: Q013's addition \"即使你懂夏·图尔语\" is stronger and directly contradicted. Q013 FINDING. Q017 FINDING (ADDITION). Fine.\n\nQ018: \"Got a character to level 50.\" → \"角色达到50级。\" fine.\n\nQ019: \"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\" → \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\" Source asks about the chest auto-extracting gems. Target adds \"即使我不会提取宝石\" (even if I don't know the extract gems talent). Context: the option's cond requires \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\" — the option only appears when the player DOES know Extract Gems talent. So the addition \"即使我不会提取宝石\" contradicts the visible condition. FINDING, ADDITION/CONDITION. Target span \"即使我不会提取宝石\". Correction: \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\". Evidence: \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end}\" verbatim: \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\". Let me get exact substring: `cond=function(npc, player) return not q:isCompleted(\"transmo-chest-extract-gems\") and q:isCompleted(\"transmo-chest\") and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end},` — I'll use \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end\".\n\nQ020: \"The Legend of Garkul\" → \"加库尔的八章传说\". Context desc: \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\" and five garkul-history lore checks. \"八章\" (eight) contradicts \"five chapters\". FINDING, VALUE. Target span \"八章\". Correction: \"加库尔的传说\" (or 五章). Evidence: \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\".\n\nNow Q004 similar: FINDING with evidence \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" Target \"七章\" correction \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" or \"魔法大爆炸的八章故事\"? The name \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" doesn't specify chapters; safest correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" (remove 七章). Claim VALUE.\n\nQ005: reconsider. \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" → \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" Issues: \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" (read) — semantics: learned vs read; minor. \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a proper title \"魔法大爆炸编年史\" — target says \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" — loses the title. Is that a substantive defect? The source is an achievement description; \"the Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a specific work. Translating as generic \"有关魔法大爆炸的文献\" loses REFERENT specificity. Also \"八\" vs \"8\" trivial. Hmm, \"Learned the eight chapters of X\" → \"阅读了有关X的8章文献\" — \"the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles\" = the 8 chapters that constitute the Chronicles; \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" = 8 chapters of documents about the Spellblaze. Roughly equivalent meaning. \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\": learned implies acquiring knowledge, reading implies the act. In achievement context, \"Learned\" means you've read/collected all. This is borderline style. I'll report no candidates for Q005, or UNCERTAIN for \"阅读了\" vs \"习得\". I'll leave empty.\n\nQ006: also check \"Failed!\" → \"失败了！\" fine. One candidate.\n\nQ002: reconsider names: \"Gorran\" → \"高岚\" is a creative transliteration; not judgeable as error without external knowledge? Well, transliteration difference isn't objective defect per se. \"Iron Throne\" → \"钢铁王座\" fine. \"read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" — the hyperbole: eyes so fine he can read Last Hope's tavern sign while sitting in Derth's tavern. Target: \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — matches. \"beardling\" → \"毛脸小子\": beardling is a dwarf term for immature dwarf (ironic since target is dwarf). \"毛脸小子\" loses the beard reference but... minor. \"I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again\" → \"我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了\" fine. \"dead wood\" → 废物 fine. \"I wouldn't put it past a dwarf to...\" → \"矮人……也不是做不出来\" fine. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets\" — \"为了翻我们的口袋，故意把我们领上这座鬼山送死\" — fine. OK, empty.\n\nQ008: reconsider subject: \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\" → \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\" — \"they\" (friends) → \"你们\" (you pl). Semantic shift: source says friends can play with same talents (as the player); target says \"you (player+friends) can play with same set\". Actually the meaning is essentially the same — the group shares the talent set. I won't flag. Empty.\n\nQ009: empty. Q012 FINDING as discussed. Actually re-examine Q012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\". Two issues: \"我的\" addition and \"profile\"→\"用户信息\" conflating with \"Show infos\" (显示信息). Given the menu has \"Show infos\" (ui=\"show\", shows UserInfo dialog) and \"Open profile\" (opens web URL data.profile), translating profile as 用户信息 conflicts. I'll report FINDING: target span \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\", claim ADDITION, correction \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\", evidence \"util.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\" — verbatim from context. Yes that's verbatim.\n\nAlso, \"Show infos\" appears in context, supporting the distinction. One candidate enough.\n\nQ016: also \"DEBUG\" → \"调试模式\" fine.\n\nNow double-check Q011 correction: \"这就是维网。\" Hmm, \"the Way\" elsewhere translated as 维网? In target \"这不是维网\" suggests established term \"维网\" for the Way. Correction: \"这就是维网。\"\n\nQ001: check \"after letting her grow as powerful as possible\" → \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她\" — \"letting her grow\" implies allowing her to grow (you let her grow). 成长到尽可能强大之后 captures. Fine.\n\nQ015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer\" — 获得称号 fine.\n\nQ007: fine.\n\nQ003: fine.\n\nQ018: fine.\n\nNow candidates per item:\n\nQ004: 1 finding.\nQ006: 1 finding.\nQ010: 1 finding.\nQ011: 1 finding.\nQ012: 1 finding.\nQ013: 1 finding.\nQ014: 1 finding.\nQ016: 1 finding.\nQ017: 1 finding.\nQ019: 1 finding.\nQ020: 1 finding.\n\nOthers empty.\n\nObservation strings: brief neutral description.\n\nQ017 verdict: FINDING or UNCERTAIN? \"你永远无法理解的文字\" — addition of \"永远\". Compare Q013 where addition clearly wrong. For Q017, the \"永远\" is an unjustified intensifier changing \"do not understand\" to \"can never understand\". I'll mark FINDING (ADDITION). Hmm — but one might argue \"which you do not understand\" describing mysterious runes could be rendered \"你无法理解的文字\", and \"永远\" is emphatic over-translation. It's a real semantic addition. FINDING.\n\nOutput JSON.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q001\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文准确传达了'让她成长到尽可能强大之后将其杀死'的含义，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q002\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"人物身份、夸张修辞（在德斯镇酒馆读到最后希望城的招牌）、方向与语气均与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q003\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"斗篷隐藏真实本质、他人只会看到普通人类等要点均完整对应，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q004\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"七章\",\n          \"correction\": \"魔法大爆炸的故事（不应出现'七章'这一具体章数）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"同一条目上下文明确该成就需要收集八章文献，译文'七章'与可见证据中的'eight chapters'矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q005\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'Learned the eight chapters'译为'阅读了……8章文献'，章数与含义基本对应，无可由可见证据判定的实质缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q006\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"SCOPE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"主线任务\",\n          \"correction\": \"任务\",\n          \"evidence\": \"[-1] = _t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#New#LAST# Quest!\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该文件是通用任务状态提示（New/Updated/Completed/Failed），适用于所有任务；译文限定为'主线任务'，扩大了原文'Quest'的范围。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q007\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'必须装备（wear）该物品才能使用'与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q008\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'点击复制''分享种子使朋友可用同一套技能游玩'与原文含义相容；'随机'为与上下文相容的补充，不构成缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q009\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'不是来聊天，是来阻止你们'忠实再现'Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!'，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q010\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"correction\": \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Display mouse gesture trails\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文设置项为'Display'（显示），上下文状态函数也按 hide_gestures 取反显示 enabled/disabled，译文'隐藏'方向相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q011\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"这不是维网。\",\n          \"correction\": \"这就是维网。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"This is the Way.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文为肯定句'This is the Way.'，译文加入否定词'不'，语义完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q012\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\",\n          \"correction\": \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"util.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该项是对聊天列表中所选用户的操作（打开其网页 profile），并非'我的'用户信息；且与菜单中'Show infos'（显示信息）项相区分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q013\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解的文字\",\n          \"evidence\": \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"此文本仅在玩家不懂夏·图尔语时显示，懂夏·图尔语时显示的是译文分支；'即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解'与可见的条件分支相矛盾，且为原文所无。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q014\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"达到白银捐赠等级\",\n          \"correction\": \"删除该补充：为《马基·埃亚尔的传说》捐赠至少 16 欧元。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"name = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该描述属于'Gold Donator'（黄金捐赠者）成就，译文补充'达到白银捐赠等级'与可见证据直接矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q015\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'在竞技场中获得毁灭者称号'与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q016\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ACTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"锁定阵营\",\n          \"correction\": \"更改阵营\",\n          \"evidence\": \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"'Alter'意为更改/改变，译文'锁定'含义完全不同。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q017\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"你永远无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解的文字\",\n          \"evidence\": \"which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文仅陈述'你看不懂'的当前状态，译文加入'永远'将状态改为永久性，属无依据的添加。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q018\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'角色达到50级'与'Got a character to level 50.'一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q019\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使我不会提取宝石\",\n          \"correction\": \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"上下文显示该选项仅在玩家已掌握'提取宝石'天赋时出现，译文'即使我不会提取宝石'与可见条件相矛盾，且为原文所无。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q020\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"八章\",\n          \"correction\": \"加库尔的传说（或'五章'）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"同一成就的描述明确为五章（garkul-history-1 至 5），译文'八章'与可见证据矛盾。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10688,"output":6769,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4935,"totalTokens":17457,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984354347,"responseId":"2026082914191514ed7af2a1894023","rawStopReason":"stop"},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你是双语翻译审核员。逐条比较英文 source 与中文 target，判断是否存在客观、实质性的翻译缺陷。\n\n规则：\n\n1. 只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题；不要依赖外部知识、仓库记忆、猜测或风格偏好。\n2. 若条目包含 source_context，可把它作为与 source 同等有效的源码证据；若没有，则只能使用 source 与 target。\n3. 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。\n4. FINDING 表示证据足以确定存在缺陷；UNCERTAIN 仅用于证据指向问题但仍有真实歧义；没有可报告的客观问题时 candidates 为空数组。\n5. 一个条目可报告多个相互独立的候选。不要因为发现一个问题而停止检查，也不要让错误候选抵消正确候选。\n6. 每个候选的 target_span 必须逐字出现在 target 中；evidence 必须逐字出现在 source，或在该条目存在时逐字出现在 source_context 中。\n7. 保持输入顺序和 neutral_id 完全不变。严格输出符合给定 schema 的 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或额外说明。\n\n缺陷类型：VALUE、DIRECTION、CONDITION、SUBJECT、REFERENT、TIMING、SCOPE、ACTION、STATE、ORDER、OMISSION、ADDITION、OTHER。\n\n输出 JSON Schema（逐字遵守）：\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 20,\n      \"maxItems\": 20,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"neutral_id\", \"candidates\", \"observation\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"neutral_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^Q[0-9]{3}$\"},\n          \"candidates\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"claim_type\", \"target_span\", \"correction\", \"evidence\"],\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"FINDING\", \"UNCERTAIN\"]},\n                \"claim_type\": {\"enum\": [\"VALUE\", \"DIRECTION\", \"CONDITION\", \"SUBJECT\", \"REFERENT\", \"TIMING\", \"SCOPE\", \"ACTION\", \"STATE\", \"ORDER\", \"OMISSION\", \"ADDITION\", \"OTHER\"]},\n                \"target_span\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"correction\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"observation\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n输入 JSON：\n{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-b-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q001\",\"source\":\"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\",\"target\":\"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Disturbed an old battlefield and survived the consequences.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"The Rat Lich\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_RATLICH\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed the terrible Rat Lich.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Shasshhiy'Kaish\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_CULTISTS\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Bringer of Doom\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_PEDESTALS\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed a Bringer of Doom.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"A living one!\\\", id = \\\"CALDIZAR\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Was teleported into Caldizar's Fortress, far into the void between the stars.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q002\",\"source\":\"#{bold}#Gorran, Cornac Archer#{normal}#\\nThat snake. That addlepated beardling. That coin-hounding, blackhearted, stump-kneed dwarf! A scout he calls himself! The finest eyes of the Iron Throne, able to read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth! Surely someone with such grandiose praise for his own eyesight would have spotted that cold drake waiting in ambush for us! Damnable thing, I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again. I can't use my bow now ... I'm effectively dead wood to the team. I'm beginning to think that Sodelost has ulterior motives... I wouldn't put it past a dwarf to lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets! I keep telling Relle, but she won't listen. The fool...\",\"target\":\"#{bold}#科纳克人弓箭手，高岚#{normal}#\\n那个毒蛇。那个没脑子的毛脸小子。那个追着钱跑、心肠漆黑、短腿跛脚的矮人！还自称斥候！还说自己是钢铁王座眼力最好的家伙，坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌！如此夸耀自己视力的人，理应发现那条等着伏击我们的寒冰飞龙才对！该死的东西，我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了。现在我拉不了弓……对队伍而言简直成了废物。我开始怀疑苏达罗斯特另有所图……矮人为了翻我们的口袋，故意把我们领上这座鬼山送死，也不是做不出来！我一再提醒瑞丽，她却听不进去。这个蠢货……\",\"source_context\":\"newLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-2\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[#{bold}#Sodelost, Dwarf Rogue#{normal}#\\nCan't believe I agreed to this expedition. I suppose it's because I've known Relle for a while. We've crossed paths many times at Derth's trading post. I even gave her a special rate for my services. Sentimental fool! All it's got me is boots filled with snow and a light coinpurse. I still don't understand why these Kingdom types are so enamoured with drakeskin... makes superior armour they say. Pah! If you can't handle metal armour, what business do you have even wearing armour? Leather has about as much use as a halfling tied to a... noises up ahead, must stop writing.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-3\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[#{bold}#Relle, Cornac Fighter & Expedition Captain#{normal}#\\nSodelost is dead, and so is Gorran. The former by Gorran's hand, the latter by my hand. Even in these wastes I cannot abide such an act of mutiny. I was aware of Gorran's anger ever since the drake attack, but I never dreamed he would turn on Sodelost like he did. He had taken my longsword as I slept the previous night, strode up to Sodelost, unheeding of I and Xann watching him, ran him through and laughed. Simply laughed. There was nothing for it; I wrenched my sword from his hand and brought it down on his neck. The commotion seems to have stirred up a nearby drake's nest, and now I fear we don't have the strength to repel a concentrated attack. We may have to abandon this expedition.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-5\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q003\",\"source\":\"I can give you a cloak that will conceal your true nature!\\nWith it all people will see when they look at you is a normal average Human. You can go about your business.\\nPlease!\",\"target\":\"我可以给你一件斗篷，它能隐藏你的真实本质！\\n穿上它，任何人看到的都只会是一个普通人类，你便可以自由行事。\\n求求你！\",\"source_context\":\"You are strong but you cannot resist them all!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"So what do you propose?\\\", jump=\\\"what\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[kill him]\\\", action=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc.die = nil\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:doEmote(_t\\\"ARRGGggg... You are alone! You will be destroyed!\\\", 60)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:die(player)\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"what\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Thanks for the information. Now you may die. [kill him]\\\", action=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc.die = nil\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:doEmote(_t\\\"ARRGGggg... You are alone! You will be destroyed!\\\", 60)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:die(player)\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nreturn \\\"welcome\\\"\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q004\",\"source\":\"Tales of the Spellblaze\",\"target\":\"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\",\"source_context\":\"-- This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\\n-- but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of\\n-- MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\\n-- GNU General Public License for more details.\\n--\\n-- You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\\n-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"SPELLBLAZE_LORE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, obj)\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-1\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-6\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-7\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-8\\\") then return false end\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q005\",\"source\":\"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\",\"target\":\"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\",\"source_context\":\"-- but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of\\n-- MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\\n-- GNU General Public License for more details.\\n--\\n-- You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\\n-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Tales of the Spellblaze\\\", id = \\\"SPELLBLAZE_LORE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, obj)\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-1\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-6\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-7\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-8\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\treturn true\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q006\",\"source\":\"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\",\"target\":\"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\",\"source_context\":\"local Dialog = require \\\"engine.ui.Dialog\\\"\\nlocal Textzone = require \\\"engine.ui.Textzone\\\"\\nlocal FontPackage = require \\\"engine.FontPackage\\\"\\nlocal Quest = require \\\"engine.Quest\\\"\\n\\nmodule(..., package.seeall, class.inherit(Dialog))\\n\\nlocal statuses = {\\n\\t[-1] = _t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#New#LAST# Quest!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.PENDING] = _t\\\"Quest #AQUAMARINE#Updated!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.COMPLETED] = _t\\\"Quest #LIGHT_GREEN#Completed!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.DONE] = _t\\\"Quest #LIGHT_GREEN#Done!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.FAILED] = _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\",\\n}\\n\\nfunction _M:init(quest, status)\\n\\tlocal use_ui = \\\"quest\\\"\\n\\tif quest.use_ui then use_ui = quest.use_ui end\\n\\tif status == Quest.FAILED then use_ui = \\\"quest-fail\\\" end\\n\\t\\n\\tif status == Quest.DONE then\\n\\t\\tif use_ui == \\\"quest-escort\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\tif quest.to_zigur then self.dialog_h_middles_alter = {b8 = \\\"ui/antimagic_complete_dialogframe_8_middle.png\\\"}\\n\\t\\t\\telse self.dialog_h_middles_alter = {b8 = \\\"ui/normal_complete_dialogframe_8_middle.png\\\"} end\\n\\t\\telseif use_ui == \\\"quest-idchallenge\\\" then self.dialog_h_middles_alter = {b8 = \\\"ui/complete_dialogframe_8_middle.png\\\"}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q007\",\"source\":\"You must wear this object to use it!\",\"target\":\"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\",\"source_context\":\"\\n\\tself.key:addBinds{ EXIT = function() game:unregisterDialog(self) end, }\\nend\\n\\nfunction _M:use(item)\\n\\tif not item then return end\\n\\tgame:unregisterDialog(self)\\n\\n\\tlocal act = item.action\\n\\n\\tif act == \\\"use\\\" then\\n\\t\\tif self.object:wornInven() and not self.object.wielded and not self.object.use_no_wear then\\n\\t\\t\\tself:simplePopup(_t\\\"Impossible\\\", _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\")\\n\\t\\telse\\n\\t\\t\\tself.actor:playerUseItem(self.object, self.item, self.inven, self.onuse)\\n\\t\\t\\tself.onuse(self.inven, self.item, self.object, true)\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\telseif act == \\\"identify\\\" then\\n\\t\\tself.object:identify(true)\\n\\t\\tself.onuse(self.inven, self.item, self.object, false)\\n\\telseif act == \\\"drop\\\" then\\n\\t\\tif self.object:getNumber() > 1 then\\n\\t\\t\\tgame:registerDialog(GetQuantity.new(_t\\\"Drop how many?\\\", (\\\"1 to %d\\\"):tformat(self.object:getNumber()), self.object:getNumber(), self.object:getNumber(), function(qty)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tqty = util.bound(qty, 1, self.object:getNumber())\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tself.actor:doDrop(self.inven, self.item, function() self.onuse(self.inven, self.item, self.object, false) end, qty)\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q008\",\"source\":\"Click to copy to clipboard. You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\",\"target\":\"点击复制。你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\ts:drawStringBlended(self.font, (player.descriptor and _t\\\"Race : \\\" or _t\\\"Type : \\\")..((player.descriptorDisplayName and _t(player:descriptorDisplayName(\\\"subrace\\\") or \\\"\\\", \\\"birth descriptor name\\\")) or _t(player.type, \\\"entity type\\\"):capitalize()), w, h, 0, 200, 255, true) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tlocal class_evo = \\\"\\\"\\n\\t\\tif player.descriptor and player.descriptor.class_evolution then class_evo = \\\" (\\\"..player.descriptor.class_evolution..\\\")\\\" end\\n\\t\\ts:drawStringBlended(self.font, (player.descriptor and _t\\\"Class: \\\" or _t\\\"Stype: \\\")..((player.descriptorDisplayName and _t(player:descriptorDisplayName(\\\"subclass\\\") or \\\"\\\", \\\"birth descriptor name\\\")) or _t(player.subtype, \\\"entity subtype\\\"):capitalize())..class_evo, w, h, 0, 200, 255, true)\\n\\t\\tif player:attr(\\\"forbid_arcane\\\") then\\n\\t\\t\\tlocal follow = (player.faction == \\\"zigur\\\" or player:attr(\\\"zigur_follower\\\")) and _t\\\"Zigur follower\\\" or _t\\\"Antimagic adherent\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_ANTIMAGIC_USER, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, \\\"#ORCHID#\\\"..follow, w+200, h, 255, 255, 255, true))\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\n\\t\\tif player.randventurer_seed then\\n\\t\\t\\tlocal text = (\\\"- Seed: #LIGHT_STEEL_BLUE#%s\\\"):tformat(player.randventurer_seed)\\n\\t\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\t\\tself:mouseClick(function() core.key.setClipboard(player.randventurer_seed) Dialog:simplePopup(\\\"Wanderer Seed\\\", \\\"Copied to clipboard!\\\") end, _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, text, w, h, 255, 255, 255, true))\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\n\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\ts:drawStringBlended(self.font, _t\\\"Size : \\\"..(player:TextSizeCategory():capitalize()), w, h, 0, 200, 255, true) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_LEVEL, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font,  (\\\"Level: #00ff00#%d\\\"):tformat(player.level), w, h, 255, 255, 255, true)) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_LEVEL, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, (\\\"Exp  : #00ff00#%2d%%\\\"):tformat(100 * cur_exp / max_exp), w, h, 255, 255, 255, true)) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_GOLD, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, (\\\"Gold : #00ff00#%0.2f\\\"):tformat(player.money), w, h, 255, 255, 255, true)) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\n\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\n\\t\\ts:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, _t\\\"#LIGHT_BLUE#Resources:\\\", w, h, 255, 255, 255, true) h = h + self.font_h\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q009\",\"source\":\"Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!\",\"target\":\"我不是来和你们聊天的，我是来阻止你们的！\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tfor uid, e in pairs(game.level.entities) do\\n\\t\\t\\tif e.define_as and (e.define_as == \\\"ELANDAR\\\" or e.define_as == \\\"ARGONIEL\\\") then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\te:setTarget(aeryn)\\n\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\tend\\nend\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"welcome\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[#LIGHT_GREEN#*The two Sorcerers stands before you, shining like the Sun.*#WHITE#\\nAh! Our guest is finally here. I take it you found the peak entertaining?]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"explain\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Why are you doing all that? You were supposed to help people!\\\", jump=\\\"explain\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"explain\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[Oh, but all we want is to help people. We have come to the self-evident conclusion that common people are just unfit to govern themselves, always bickering, arguing...\\nSince the last invasion of the orcs there has been no threat to unite them!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"So you have decided to become the threat yourselves?\\\", jump=\\\"explain2\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q010\",\"source\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#Display mouse gesture trails#WHITE##{normal}#\",\"target\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#隐藏鼠标手势轨迹#WHITE##{normal}#\",\"source_context\":\"\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"Always display combat properties of shields even if you don't know shield attack talents.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"#GOLD##{bold}#Always show shield combat properties#WHITE##{normal}#\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats and _t\\\"enabled\\\" or _t\\\"disabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.tome.display_shield_stats = not config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats\\n\\t\\tgame:saveSettings(\\\"tome.display_shield_stats\\\", (\\\"tome.display_shield_stats = %s\\\\n\\\"):format(tostring(config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats)))\\n\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.hide_gestures and _t\\\"disabled\\\" or _t\\\"enabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\\n\\t\\tgame:saveSettings(\\\"hide_gestures\\\", (\\\"hide_gestures = %s\\\\n\\\"):format(tostring(config.settings.hide_gestures)))\\n\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"If enabled new quests and quests updates will display a big popup, if not a simple line of text will fly on the screen.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"#GOLD##{bold}#Big Quest Popups#WHITE##{normal}#\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.tome.quest_popup and _t\\\"enabled\\\" or _t\\\"disabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.tome.quest_popup = not config.settings.tome.quest_popup\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q011\",\"source\":\"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*He leans toward you. Your mind is suddenly filled with feelings of peace and happiness.*#WHITE#\\nThis is the Way.\",\"target\":\"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他靠向你，你的脑海里突然充满了平静和幸福。*#WHITE#\\n这不是维网。\",\"source_context\":\"--\\t\\t{_t\\\"So you will wander the land alone?\\\", jump=\\\"done\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"done\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[I am never alone. I have the Way.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Farewell, then.\\\", action=function(npc, player) npc:disappear() end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"way\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Thank you for this vision. Farewell, my friend.\\\", action=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:disappear()\\n\\t\\t\\tgame:setAllowedBuild(\\\"yeek\\\", true)\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\n-----------------------------------------------------------\\n-- Yeek version\\n-----------------------------------------------------------\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q012\",\"source\":\"Open profile(in browser)\",\"target\":\"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif citem and citem.login then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal data = profile.chat:getUserInfo(citem.login)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tif data then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal list = {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Show infos\\\", ui=\\\"show\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Whisper\\\", ui=\\\"whisper\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Ignore\\\", ui=\\\"ignore\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", ui=\\\"profile\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Report for bad behavior\\\", ui=\\\"report\\\"}\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif data.char_link then table.insert(list, 3, {name=_t\\\"Open charsheet(in browser)\\\", ui=\\\"charsheet\\\"}) end\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tDialog:listPopup((\\\"User: \\\"):tformat(citem.login), _t\\\"Action\\\", list, 300, 200, function(sel)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif not sel or not sel.ui then return end\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif sel.ui == \\\"show\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal UserInfo = require \\\"engine.dialogs.UserInfo\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tgame:registerDialog(UserInfo.new(data))\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\telseif sel.ui == \\\"profile\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tutil.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\telseif sel.ui == \\\"charsheet\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tutil.browserOpenUrl(data.char_link, {is_external=true})\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q013\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：#{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\",\"source_context\":\"\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore2.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[In this picture a huge god with glowing eyes towers above the land, and in his right hand he holds high the sun. The other gods are running from him, wincing from the light.\\nThere is some text underneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Fa AMAKTHEL tabak, ik koru bazan tro yu, ik ranaheli tobol don schek ruun. Ik blana dem Soli as banafel ik goriz uf Eyal ik blod, \\\"Tro fasa goru domus asam, ik goru domit tro Eyal.\\\"'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'But AMAKTHEL came, and his might surpassed all else, and the petty gods fled before his glory. And he made the Sun from his breath and held it above the world and said, \\\"All that this light touches shall be mine, and this light shall touch all the world.'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-3\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"third mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore3.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[This picture shows the huge god holding some smaller figures in his hands and pointing out at the lands beyond. You imagine these figures must be the Sher'Tul.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'And AMAKTHEL made the SHER'TUL, and gave unto us the powers to achieve all that we set our will to, and said to us \\\"Go forth to where the light touches and take all for your own.\\\"'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"fourth mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore4.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[You see a mural showing a huge metropolis made of crystal, with small islands of stone floating in the air behind it. In the foreground is sitting a Sher'Tul, with a hand stretched up to the sky.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'We conquered the world, and built for ourselves towering cities of crystal and fortresses that travelled the skies. But some were not content...'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q014\",\"source\":\"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\",\"target\":\"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\",\"source_context\":\"newAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Bronze Donator\\\", id = \\\"BRONZE_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated up to 5 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Silver Donator\\\", id = \\\"SILVER_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated at least 6 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Stralite Donator\\\", id = \\\"STRALITE_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated at least 31 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Voratun Donator\\\", id = \\\"VORATUN_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated more than 60 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q015\",\"source\":\"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\",\"target\":\"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Became the new master of the arena in 30-wave mode.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Master of Arena\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Became the new master of the arena in 60-wave mode.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"XXX the Destroyer\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Grand Master\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Earned the rank of Grand Master in the arena.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Ten at one blow\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed 10 or more enemies in one single attack in the arena.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q016\",\"source\":\"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\",\"target\":\"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\",\"source_context\":\"-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nrequire \\\"engine.class\\\"\\nlocal Dialog = require \\\"engine.ui.Dialog\\\"\\nlocal List = require \\\"engine.ui.List\\\"\\nlocal Faction = require \\\"engine.Faction\\\"\\nlocal GetQuantity = require \\\"engine.dialogs.GetQuantity\\\"\\n\\nmodule(..., package.seeall, class.inherit(Dialog))\\n\\nfunction _M:init()\\n\\tself:generateList()\\n\\tDialog.init(self, _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", 1, 1)\\n\\n\\tlocal list = List.new{width=400, height=500, list=self.list, fct=function(item) self:use(item) end}\\n\\n\\tself:loadUI{\\n\\t\\t{left=0, top=0, ui=list},\\n\\t}\\n\\tself:setupUI(true, true)\\n\\n\\tself.key:addCommands{ __TEXTINPUT = function(c)\\n\\t\\tfor i = list.sel + 1, #self.list do\\n\\t\\t\\tlocal v = self.list[i]\\n\\t\\t\\tif v.name:sub(1, 1):lower() == c:lower() then list:select(i) return end\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q017\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"你永远无法理解的文字：#{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#\",\"source_context\":\"\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore3.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[This picture shows the huge god holding some smaller figures in his hands and pointing out at the lands beyond. You imagine these figures must be the Sher'Tul.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'And AMAKTHEL made the SHER'TUL, and gave unto us the powers to achieve all that we set our will to, and said to us \\\"Go forth to where the light touches and take all for your own.\\\"'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"fourth mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore4.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[You see a mural showing a huge metropolis made of crystal, with small islands of stone floating in the air behind it. In the foreground is sitting a Sher'Tul, with a hand stretched up to the sky.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'We conquered the world, and built for ourselves towering cities of crystal and fortresses that travelled the skies. But some were not content...'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-5\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"fifth mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore5.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[This mural shows nine Sher'Tul standing side by side, each holding aloft a dark weapon. Your eyes are drawn to a runed staff held by the red-robed figure in the centre. It seems familiar somehow...\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Zubadon koref noch hesen, ik dorudon koref noch pasor. Cosief maro dondreth karatu - Ranaduzil - ik jein belsan ovrienis.'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'Of pride we accepted no equals, and of greed we accepted no servitude. We made for ourselves terrible weapons - the Godslayers - and nine were chosen to wield them.'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q018\",\"source\":\"Got a character to level 50.\",\"target\":\"角色达到50级。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tname = \\\"Level 30\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got a character to level 30.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Level 40\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got a character to level 40.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Level 50\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Unstoppable\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Returned from the dead.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Utterly Destroyed\\\", id = \\\"EIDOLON_DEATH\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Died on the Eidolon Plane.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q019\",\"source\":\"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\",\"target\":\"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t{_t\\\"What are you, and what is this place?\\\", jump=\\\"what\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"what\\\", action=set\\\"what\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Master? I am not your mas...\\\", jump=\\\"master\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"master\\\", action=set\\\"master\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Why do I understand you? The texts are unreadable to me.\\\", jump=\\\"understand\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"understand\\\", action=set\\\"understand\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"What can I do here?\\\", jump=\\\"storage\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"storage\\\", action=set\\\"storage\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"What else can this place do?\\\", jump=\\\"energy\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"energy\\\", action=set\\\"energy\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Would it be possible to improve my Cloak of Deception so I do not need to wear it to pass as a living being?\\\", jump=\\\"permanent-cloak\\\", \\n\\t\\t\\tcond=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal cloak = player:findInAllInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"CLOAK_DECEPTION\\\")\\n\\t\\t\\t\\treturn not q:isCompleted(\\\"permanent-cloak\\\") and q:isCompleted(\\\"transmo-chest\\\") and cloak\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"You asked me to come, about a farportal?\\\", jump=\\\"farportal\\\", cond=function() return q:isCompleted(\\\"farportal\\\") and not q:isCompleted(\\\"farportal-spawn\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"You asked me to come, about the rod of recall?\\\", jump=\\\"recall\\\", cond=function() return q:isCompleted(\\\"recall\\\") and not q:isCompleted(\\\"recall-done\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"transmo-gems\\\", cond=function(npc, player) return not q:isCompleted(\\\"transmo-chest-extract-gems\\\") and q:isCompleted(\\\"transmo-chest\\\") and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Are there any training facilities?\\\", jump=\\\"training\\\", cond=function() return not q:isCompleted(\\\"training\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Can you use your magic to alter the appearance of my gear?\\\", jump=\\\"shimmer\\\", cond=function() return not q:isCompleted(\\\"shimmer\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I find your appearance unsettling. Any way you can change it?\\\", jump=\\\"changetile\\\", cond=function() return q:isCompleted(\\\"recall-done\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I have come upon a strange thing indeed. #LIGHT_GREEN#[tell him about Melinda]\\\", jump=\\\"cure-melinda\\\", cond=function() return ql and ql:isStatus(engine.Quest.COMPLETED, \\\"saved-beach\\\") and not ql:isStatus(engine.Quest.FAILED) and not ql:isStatus(engine.Quest.COMPLETED, \\\"can_come_fortress\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[leave]\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"master\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[*#LIGHT_GREEN#The creature glares at you.#WHITE#*\\nYou possess a control rod. You are the master.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q020\",\"source\":\"The Legend of Garkul\",\"target\":\"加库尔的八章传说\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-6\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-7\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-8\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\treturn true\\n\\tend\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"GARKUL_LORE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, obj)\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-1\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\treturn true\\n\\tend,\\n\\ton_gain = function()\"}]}"}],"timestamp":1787984354338},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me review each item.\n\nQ001: source \"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\" target \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\" — accurate. \"after letting her grow\" — 成长到尽可能强大之后, fine. No issue.\n\nQ002: source is Gorran, Cornac Archer. Target: \"科纳克人弓箭手，高岚\". \"addlepated beardling\" → \"没脑子的毛脸小子\" — beardling refers to a young/immature dwarf; Gorran calls Sodelost beardling. \"毛脸小子\" is plausible. \"The finest eyes of the Iron Throne, able to read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth!\" Target: \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — from the tavern in Derth reading the sign in Last Hope. Direction: he's in Derth reading Last Hope's sign. Translation says \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — sitting in Derth's tavern can see Last Hope's tavern sign. That matches. Names: Gorran → 高岚 (odd transliteration but allowed?). Last Hope → 最后的希望城, Derth → 德斯镇, Sodelost → 苏达罗斯特, Relle → 瑞丽. \"I'm effectively dead wood to the team\" → \"对队伍而言简直成了废物\" ok. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die\" — ok. Seems fine. Maybe \"还自称斥候！还说自己是钢铁王座眼力最好的家伙\" — \"A scout he calls himself!\" fine. No finding.\n\nActually check \"coin-hounding\" → 追着钱跑, fine. \"stump-kneed\" → 短腿跛脚, ok.\n\nQ003: \"I can give you a cloak that will conceal your true nature! With it all people will see when they look at you is a normal average Human. You can go about your business. Please!\" Target matches. \"Please!\" → \"求求你！\" fine. No issue.\n\nQ004: \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" → \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\". Context: achievement desc \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" — the game has eight chapters, so \"七章\" (seven chapters) contradicts \"eight chapters\" in visible context. FINDING, VALUE/ADDITION. Target span \"七章\". Correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" or 八章. Evidence: \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" Note \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" is also the game title; but the numeric error is objective.\n\nQ005: \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" → \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" Hmm — \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a specific title (编年史). \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" loses title specificity but that's minor. \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" (read) vs learned; acceptable? Learned vs read — slight change but plausibly fine. Also the original is a title \"Spellblaze Chronicles\". I'd say no strong objective defect. Could flag \"阅读了\" vs \"习得/学会了\"? That's style. Skip.\n\nQ006: \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\" → \"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\". \"Quest\" → \"主线任务\" — quest isn't necessarily main quest; visible context shows generic quests (New Quest!, Quest Updated!, etc.). Claiming \"main quest\" is an addition/scope error. FINDING, SCOPE/VALUE. Target span \"主线任务\". Correction: \"任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\". Evidence: \"[-1] = _t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#New#LAST# Quest!\\\",\" showing generic quests.\n\nQ007: \"You must wear this object to use it!\" → \"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\" fine. wear → 装备, ok.\n\nQ008: \"Click to copy to clipboard. You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\" Target: \"点击复制。你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\" \"they can play\" → \"你们可以\" (you all can) — direction/subject change? \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\" — friends can play. Target \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合\" — \"你们\" plural includes the player. Hmm, is that a defect? It changes \"they\" (friends) to \"you (plural)\". Slight subject change but meaning roughly compatible... Actually \"they can play with the same set of talents\" means friends play with same talents as the player. \"你们可以用同一套技能组合\" implies both share. This is arguably fine semantically. Also \"wanderer seed\" → \"流浪者随机种子\" — added 随机 (random), addition but compatible per rule 3. \"Click to copy to clipboard\" → \"点击复制\" — omits clipboard, minor omission; context shows \"Copied to clipboard!\" popup. Is omitting \"to clipboard\" a substantive omission? Minor. I could report as UNCERTAIN or skip. I'll skip; meaning retained adequately? The instruction says report objective substantive defects. Omission of \"到剪贴板\" is minor, not substantive. Skip.\n\nQ009: \"Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!\" → \"我不是来和你们聊天的，我是来阻止你们的！\" Meaning preserved. Fine.\n\nQ010: \"Display mouse gesture trails\" → \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\" — Display → 隐藏 (hide). Direct VALUE/DIRECTION error. FINDING. Target span \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\". Correction: \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\". Evidence: \"Display mouse gesture trails\" and status function \"config.settings.hide_gestures and _t\\\"disabled\\\" or _t\\\"enabled\\\"\" confirming the setting is display. FINDING.\n\nQ011: \"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse. ... This is the Way.\" → target last line \"这不是维网。\" — \"This is the Way\" → \"这不是维网\" adds negation \"不\" and \"维网\" weird. Source: \"This is the Way.\" Target \"这不是维网。\" — clear VALUE error (added negation). FINDING. Correction: \"这就是维网。\" or \"这就是'道'。\" Target span \"这不是维网。\". Evidence: \"This is the Way.\".\n\nAlso first line \"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\" → \"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\" fine.\n\nQ012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\". \"profile\" → \"我的用户信息\" — profile vs user info; context has separate \"Show infos\" item. \"Open profile\" opens the web profile (data.profile URL). Translating as \"用户信息\" conflicts with \"Show infos\"? Hmm. \"profile\" → \"用户资料\" would be better. Is \"打开我的用户信息\" a defect? It's a chat user's profile, not \"my\". \"我的\" (my) — the profile belongs to the clicked user, not \"me\". That's a REFERENT/SUBJECT error. Also context: listPopup(\"User: %s\") — the menu is for a user. \"我的用户信息\" — added \"my\". Hmm, could be interpretation as \"打开(该)用户资料\". The \"我的\" is questionable but maybe it's a common phrasing? Objective: source \"Open profile\" opens the profile of the selected user (citem.login). Adding \"我的\" changes referent. I'd report UNCERTAIN or FINDING. I think FINDING: REFERENT, span \"我的用户信息\", correction \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\", evidence \"local data = profile.chat:getUserInfo(citem.login)\" plus \"{name=_t\\\"Show infos\\\"...\" showing it's another user's profile. Evidence must be verbatim from source_context: \"if citem and citem.login then\" — I'll use \"local data = profile.chat:getUserInfo(citem.login)\". That's verbatim.\n\nQ013: \"which you do not understand:\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：\" — \"which you do not understand\" → \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解\" (even if you know Sher'Tul you cannot understand). This changes condition — the source is plain \"you do not understand\". The addition \"即使你懂夏·图尔语\" is contradictory with the context: this text is shown when player does NOT speak shertul (not game.player:attr(\"speaks_shertul\")). So saying \"even if you knew Sher'Tul\" is an addition not supported; actually contradicts? The branch is when player doesn't speak Shertul. Claim \"even if you knew Shertul language, you can't understand\" is added info. Is it compatible? Hmm, per rule 3, new info compatible with evidence and can't be judged wrong by evidence... The context shows this string appears when the player does not speak shertul. The claim \"even if you understand Sher'Tul you cannot understand this text\" — is it contradicted? The parallel string for speakers shows translated text, meaning if you speak shertul you CAN understand. So the addition is arguably contradicted by the visible alternative branch which shows the translated text when speaks_shertul is true. So it's a CONDITION error — adding \"即使你懂夏·图尔语\" (even if you know Sher'Tul). I'd report FINDING: ADDITION/CONDITION. Target span \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\". Correction: \"你无法理解的文字\". Evidence: \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\" and the or-branch showing translated text. Evidence string must be verbatim: \"(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\" — verbatim from context. Use \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\".\n\nHmm, is \"even if you knew Shertul\" truly a defect? It says the text is incomprehensible regardless. In-game, if you speak shertul you get translation. So the claim is false in-game, and unsupported. I'll report FINDING CONDITION.\n\nQ014: \"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\" → \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\" Context: the SOURCE_MATCH is in GOLD_DONATOR achievement; Silver Donator is \"at least 6 euros\". Target says \"达到白银捐赠等级\" (reaching Silver donator level) — the achievement is \"Gold Donator\". Adding \"达到白银捐赠等级\" contradicts context (GOLD_DONATOR). FINDING, ADDITION/VALUE. Target span \"达到白银捐赠等级\". Correction: remove, e.g. \"为《马基·埃亚尔的传说》捐赠至少 16 欧元。\" Evidence: \"name = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\"\" verbatim.\n\nAlso game title \"Tales of Maj'Eyal\" → \"马基·埃亚尔的传说\" fine.\n\nQ015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\" → \"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\" fine. Achievement name \"XXX the Destroyer\". OK.\n\nQ016: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" → \"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\". \"Alter\" → \"锁定\" (lock) — DIRECTION/VALUE error. \"Alter Faction\" means change faction; \"锁定阵营\" means lock faction. FINDING. Target span \"锁定阵营\". Correction: \"更改阵营\" or \"改变阵营\". Evidence: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" — wait, evidence must be verbatim in source: source is \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\". Yes.\n\nQ017: \"which you do not understand:\" → \"你永远无法理解的文字：\" — \"永远\" (never/forever) added. Source: \"which you do not understand\" (current state). \"你永远无法理解\" = \"which you can never understand\". Addition of permanence. Is it substantive? It changes STATE to permanent. Similar to Q013 but weaker. Hmm. The context: this is the branch when player does not speak shertul; if they later speak shertul, they'd get the translation (actually lore is read once?). The addition \"永远\" is an intensifier not in source. Is it objectively wrong? It asserts inability forever, whereas source asserts current non-understanding. I'd say FINDING VALUE/STATE... or UNCERTAIN. \"which you do not understand\" — describing the text as incomprehensible to you; \"永远无法理解\" adds \"never\". It's a real semantic addition. I'll report FINDING with claim_type STATE, correction \"你无法理解的文字\". Hmm, could argue it's stylistic intensification. But \"never\" vs \"do not\" is a temporal/scope change. I'll go FINDING... Actually, being cautious: many translation reviews would flag 永远 as addition. Rule 3: added info compatible with visible evidence and cannot be judged wrong by evidence — can it be judged wrong? The evidence shows a translated version exists for shertul speakers, so \"永远无法理解\" is falsifiable within game logic? If a player learns shertul later... lore already read. Eh. I'll mark UNCERTAIN. Hmm, decide: FINDING for Q013 (condition contradiction) and UNCERTAIN for Q017 (adds 永远). Actually Q017's addition similar to Q013 but without the \"即使你懂\" clause. \"你永远无法理解的文字\" vs \"which you do not understand\". The \"永远\" adds permanence. I'll report as FINDING with STATE? Let me think about severity: \"do not understand\" → \"永远无法理解\" is a clear addition of \"永远\" with no source basis. That's an objective ADDITION. But is it substantive? It changes the meaning. I'll report FINDING, ADDITION, correction \"你无法理解的文字\", evidence \"which you do not understand:\". Evidence verbatim: \"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth...\" — the source is exactly that. Use \"which you do not understand:\".\n\nHmm, but rule 3 could make 永远 permissible embellishment? It's not \"specific information\" like a number or name; it's a modal/temporal change. I'll keep FINDING but maybe UNCERTAIN is safer. I'll go FINDING — actually let me reconsider: reviewers flag \"永远\" as over-translation, changing meaning. Yes, FINDING.\n\nWait, Q013 vs Q017: Q013's addition \"即使你懂夏·图尔语\" is stronger and directly contradicted. Q013 FINDING. Q017 FINDING (ADDITION). Fine.\n\nQ018: \"Got a character to level 50.\" → \"角色达到50级。\" fine.\n\nQ019: \"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\" → \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\" Source asks about the chest auto-extracting gems. Target adds \"即使我不会提取宝石\" (even if I don't know the extract gems talent). Context: the option's cond requires \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\" — the option only appears when the player DOES know Extract Gems talent. So the addition \"即使我不会提取宝石\" contradicts the visible condition. FINDING, ADDITION/CONDITION. Target span \"即使我不会提取宝石\". Correction: \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\". Evidence: \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end}\" verbatim: \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\". Let me get exact substring: `cond=function(npc, player) return not q:isCompleted(\"transmo-chest-extract-gems\") and q:isCompleted(\"transmo-chest\") and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end},` — I'll use \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end\".\n\nQ020: \"The Legend of Garkul\" → \"加库尔的八章传说\". Context desc: \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\" and five garkul-history lore checks. \"八章\" (eight) contradicts \"five chapters\". FINDING, VALUE. Target span \"八章\". Correction: \"加库尔的传说\" (or 五章). Evidence: \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\".\n\nNow Q004 similar: FINDING with evidence \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" Target \"七章\" correction \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" or \"魔法大爆炸的八章故事\"? The name \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" doesn't specify chapters; safest correction: \"魔法大爆炸的故事\" (remove 七章). Claim VALUE.\n\nQ005: reconsider. \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" → \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" Issues: \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" (read) — semantics: learned vs read; minor. \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a proper title \"魔法大爆炸编年史\" — target says \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" — loses the title. Is that a substantive defect? The source is an achievement description; \"the Spellblaze Chronicles\" is a specific work. Translating as generic \"有关魔法大爆炸的文献\" loses REFERENT specificity. Also \"八\" vs \"8\" trivial. Hmm, \"Learned the eight chapters of X\" → \"阅读了有关X的8章文献\" — \"the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles\" = the 8 chapters that constitute the Chronicles; \"有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献\" = 8 chapters of documents about the Spellblaze. Roughly equivalent meaning. \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\": learned implies acquiring knowledge, reading implies the act. In achievement context, \"Learned\" means you've read/collected all. This is borderline style. I'll report no candidates for Q005, or UNCERTAIN for \"阅读了\" vs \"习得\". I'll leave empty.\n\nQ006: also check \"Failed!\" → \"失败了！\" fine. One candidate.\n\nQ002: reconsider names: \"Gorran\" → \"高岚\" is a creative transliteration; not judgeable as error without external knowledge? Well, transliteration difference isn't objective defect per se. \"Iron Throne\" → \"钢铁王座\" fine. \"read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" — the hyperbole: eyes so fine he can read Last Hope's tavern sign while sitting in Derth's tavern. Target: \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — matches. \"beardling\" → \"毛脸小子\": beardling is a dwarf term for immature dwarf (ironic since target is dwarf). \"毛脸小子\" loses the beard reference but... minor. \"I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again\" → \"我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了\" fine. \"dead wood\" → 废物 fine. \"I wouldn't put it past a dwarf to...\" → \"矮人……也不是做不出来\" fine. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets\" — \"为了翻我们的口袋，故意把我们领上这座鬼山送死\" — fine. OK, empty.\n\nQ008: reconsider subject: \"this way they can play with the same set of talents\" → \"这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩\" — \"they\" (friends) → \"你们\" (you pl). Semantic shift: source says friends can play with same talents (as the player); target says \"you (player+friends) can play with same set\". Actually the meaning is essentially the same — the group shares the talent set. I won't flag. Empty.\n\nQ009: empty. Q012 FINDING as discussed. Actually re-examine Q012: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\". Two issues: \"我的\" addition and \"profile\"→\"用户信息\" conflating with \"Show infos\" (显示信息). Given the menu has \"Show infos\" (ui=\"show\", shows UserInfo dialog) and \"Open profile\" (opens web URL data.profile), translating profile as 用户信息 conflicts. I'll report FINDING: target span \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\", claim ADDITION, correction \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\", evidence \"util.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\" — verbatim from context. Yes that's verbatim.\n\nAlso, \"Show infos\" appears in context, supporting the distinction. One candidate enough.\n\nQ016: also \"DEBUG\" → \"调试模式\" fine.\n\nNow double-check Q011 correction: \"这就是维网。\" Hmm, \"the Way\" elsewhere translated as 维网? In target \"这不是维网\" suggests established term \"维网\" for the Way. Correction: \"这就是维网。\"\n\nQ001: check \"after letting her grow as powerful as possible\" → \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她\" — \"letting her grow\" implies allowing her to grow (you let her grow). 成长到尽可能强大之后 captures. Fine.\n\nQ015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer\" — 获得称号 fine.\n\nQ007: fine.\n\nQ003: fine.\n\nQ018: fine.\n\nNow candidates per item:\n\nQ004: 1 finding.\nQ006: 1 finding.\nQ010: 1 finding.\nQ011: 1 finding.\nQ012: 1 finding.\nQ013: 1 finding.\nQ014: 1 finding.\nQ016: 1 finding.\nQ017: 1 finding.\nQ019: 1 finding.\nQ020: 1 finding.\n\nOthers empty.\n\nObservation strings: brief neutral description.\n\nQ017 verdict: FINDING or UNCERTAIN? \"你永远无法理解的文字\" — addition of \"永远\". Compare Q013 where addition clearly wrong. For Q017, the \"永远\" is an unjustified intensifier changing \"do not understand\" to \"can never understand\". I'll mark FINDING (ADDITION). Hmm — but one might argue \"which you do not understand\" describing mysterious runes could be rendered \"你无法理解的文字\", and \"永远\" is emphatic over-translation. It's a real semantic addition. FINDING.\n\nOutput JSON.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q001\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文准确传达了'让她成长到尽可能强大之后将其杀死'的含义，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q002\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"人物身份、夸张修辞（在德斯镇酒馆读到最后希望城的招牌）、方向与语气均与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q003\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"斗篷隐藏真实本质、他人只会看到普通人类等要点均完整对应，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q004\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"七章\",\n          \"correction\": \"魔法大爆炸的故事（不应出现'七章'这一具体章数）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"同一条目上下文明确该成就需要收集八章文献，译文'七章'与可见证据中的'eight chapters'矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q005\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'Learned the eight chapters'译为'阅读了……8章文献'，章数与含义基本对应，无可由可见证据判定的实质缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q006\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"SCOPE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"主线任务\",\n          \"correction\": \"任务\",\n          \"evidence\": \"[-1] = _t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#New#LAST# Quest!\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该文件是通用任务状态提示（New/Updated/Completed/Failed），适用于所有任务；译文限定为'主线任务'，扩大了原文'Quest'的范围。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q007\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'必须装备（wear）该物品才能使用'与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q008\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'点击复制''分享种子使朋友可用同一套技能游玩'与原文含义相容；'随机'为与上下文相容的补充，不构成缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q009\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'不是来聊天，是来阻止你们'忠实再现'Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!'，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q010\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"correction\": \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Display mouse gesture trails\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文设置项为'Display'（显示），上下文状态函数也按 hide_gestures 取反显示 enabled/disabled，译文'隐藏'方向相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q011\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"这不是维网。\",\n          \"correction\": \"这就是维网。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"This is the Way.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文为肯定句'This is the Way.'，译文加入否定词'不'，语义完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q012\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\",\n          \"correction\": \"打开用户资料（在浏览器中打开）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"util.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该项是对聊天列表中所选用户的操作（打开其网页 profile），并非'我的'用户信息；且与菜单中'Show infos'（显示信息）项相区分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q013\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解的文字\",\n          \"evidence\": \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"此文本仅在玩家不懂夏·图尔语时显示，懂夏·图尔语时显示的是译文分支；'即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解'与可见的条件分支相矛盾，且为原文所无。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q014\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"达到白银捐赠等级\",\n          \"correction\": \"删除该补充：为《马基·埃亚尔的传说》捐赠至少 16 欧元。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"name = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该描述属于'Gold Donator'（黄金捐赠者）成就，译文补充'达到白银捐赠等级'与可见证据直接矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q015\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'在竞技场中获得毁灭者称号'与原文一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q016\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ACTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"锁定阵营\",\n          \"correction\": \"更改阵营\",\n          \"evidence\": \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"'Alter'意为更改/改变，译文'锁定'含义完全不同。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q017\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"你永远无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解的文字\",\n          \"evidence\": \"which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原文仅陈述'你看不懂'的当前状态，译文加入'永远'将状态改为永久性，属无依据的添加。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q018\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'角色达到50级'与'Got a character to level 50.'一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q019\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使我不会提取宝石\",\n          \"correction\": \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"上下文显示该选项仅在玩家已掌握'提取宝石'天赋时出现，译文'即使我不会提取宝石'与可见条件相矛盾，且为原文所无。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q020\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"八章\",\n          \"correction\": \"加库尔的传说（或'五章'）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"同一成就的描述明确为五章（garkul-history-1 至 5），译文'八章'与可见证据矛盾。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10688,"output":6769,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4935,"totalTokens":17457,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984354347,"responseId":"2026082914191514ed7af2a1894023","rawStopReason":"stop"}],"willRetry":false}
